License:              Apache License 2.0
License File:         com.fasterxml.jackson.core.jackson-databind.license

com.onlyoffice.docs-integration-sdk - ONLYOFFICE Docs Integration SDK, bundled in onlyoffice-nuxeo-core (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
License:              Apache License 2.0
License File:         com.onlyoffice.docs-integration-sdk.license

