License:                Apache 2.0
License File:           httpclient5.license

httpcore5             - Apache HttpCore, bundled in onlyoffice-nuxeo-core (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
License:                Apache 2.0
License File:           httpcore5.license

